# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# INTENTIONAL: These SHOULD be tracked in git (configuration as code)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# - config/*.yaml         ← Configuration is source-controlled for audit trail
# - engine/*.py           ← Core logic is source-controlled
# - .env.example          ← Template is source-controlled (users copy it)
# - schemas/*.json        ← Schemas are source-controlled (validation rules)
# - CLAUDE.md             ← AI context is source-controlled
# - DECISIONS.md          ← Architectural decisions are documented
# - MODIFICATION_CHECKLIST.md ← Safeguards are documented
# - DEPENDENCIES.md       ← System understanding is documented
# - ONBOARDING.md         ← Training material is source-controlled
# - AI_SESSION_TEMPLATE.md ← Memory format is standardized
# - hooks.sh              ← CLI tool is source-controlled
# - All documentation (*.md files) ← Docs are version-controlled

# DO NOT add these patterns:
# - Don't add config/*.yaml (WRONG: these are intentional config)
# - Don't add engine/*.py (WRONG: these are core logic)
# - Don't add .env.example (WRONG: this is the template)
